# Flow 5, Today: Home > Today's note makes 2026-10-24.md at the vault root (the test clock) and opens it in the editor;
# Ctrl+T inserts the date and time; Ctrl+D later opens the same note again; More > Insert date and time.
wait 900
expect text "2026-10-24"
tap "Today’s note"
tap "Today’s note"
wait 500
expect state page editor
expect state note 2026-10-24.md
expect file "2026-10-24.md" exists
type Market at 9.
key enter
key ctrl-t
wait 1700
expect file "2026-10-24.md" contains "Market at 9.\n2026-10-24 14:03"
shot 01-today
key esc
wait 400
expect state page home
expect state notes 1
key ctrl-d
wait 500
expect state page editor
expect state note 2026-10-24.md
key ctrl-end
key enter
key ctrl-o
wait 400
key down
key down
key enter
wait 1700
expect file "2026-10-24.md" contains "2026-10-24 14:03\n2026-10-24 14:03"
shot 02-stamp-from-more
key esc
wait 300
